' Autor: Karlo Čehulić
' Verzija 1.0
' Dijagram prikazuje dohvat detalja događaja
@startuml

title get events

skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ArrowColor #212529

skinparam sequence {
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #E7F1FF
    ParticipantBorderColor #0D6EFD
    ActorBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
    ActorBorderColor #212529
    LifeLineBorderColor #212529
}

actor User
participant WebSucelje
participant Backend
database Database

User -> WebSucelje: Open One Event
activate WebSucelje
WebSucelje -> Backend: GET api/events/:event_id
activate Backend

Backend --> Database: get_event(event_id)
activate Database
opt Event doesn't exist
Database --> Backend: null
   Backend-->WebSucelje: Error
   WebSucelje-->User: Show Error
else no error
Database --> Backend: events data
deactivate Database


Backend--> WebSucelje: events data
deactivate Backend

WebSucelje-->User: Load Events on Page
end
@enduml
